          "author": "Hunter Laux",
          "date": "1792620887",
          "subject": "klippy_connection: use dict view intersection in _process_status_update",
          "message": "Periodic status updates from Klippy typically contain only a few changed\nobjects, whereas client subscriptions from web UIs often contain hundreds\nof objects. Using the dict view intersection (sub.keys() & status.keys())\navoids walking every subscribed object name for every client connection\non every status update.\n\nSigned-off-by: Hunter Laux <hunterlaux@gmail.com>",
